{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_04",
  "title": "破空的飞羽",
  "storyCode": "CF-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5d167446bb7e2f96a9f6fefb7b06d3e6464af59377b73719d98da3a55298e31",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "学者猫，快去树上！角兽群要来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "来不及了！夜刀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "我在赶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "text": "喵！吃我臭臭喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "工匠猫，你扔的是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "臭！臭死了！那些羽兽又来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "有效果！兽群改变方向了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "工匠猫，你用的这是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "text": "羽兽，臭臭！异臭球喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "啊，是这个喵！真不愧是我的小工匠，竟然这么快就拿羽兽的粪便做好了异臭球！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "如果把异臭球扔到怪物身上，它们就会无法忍受这个味道跑开了喵，就像我们躲开黑角一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "喂，不要拿俺举例子啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "只是暂时改变了方向，角兽群仍在森林中横冲直撞，这样下去可麻烦了，火龙的踪迹很可能会被它们破坏掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "角兽的狂奔......俺觉得绝对不是正常的现象。它们怎么会无缘无故地发狂呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "原因不重要，我们最好现在就阻止它们的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "以我的知识推测，要使这么大规模的兽群移动，一定会有一个像领头兽一样的家伙带领方向的喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "真的吗？如果是这样的话，只要把它砍了就够了，很简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "等等，什么叫只要把它砍了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "字面意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "你打算怎么去把它砍了哇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "直接冲进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "这么多角兽，还都是狂奔状态下......你确定吗？发狂的原因也不能确定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "没有时间等待我们去确认最终原因了，我必须速战速决，你来掩护我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "再等等！工匠猫，你还有那个......异臭球吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "text": "臭臭！好多喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "学者猫，俺想确认一下，如果把那个臭味弄在领头兽身上的话，其他的角兽有可能会散开吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "根据它们刚刚的反应，理论上来说......会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "但是可能时间不会太久喵！异臭球得离得很近才能确保命中角兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "够了，俺有个法子，让俺从树上接近，争取以最近的距离去命中领头兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "夜刀，你抓住其他角兽散开的时机跳下来，一招制服领头兽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "我明白了，就这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "不过这样你就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "更臭了而已，没有问题——呕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "现在......还来得及......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "它们太快了，太年轻，充满力量，难以掌控。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "过去被压抑的在膨胀，这片森林的危险从未减弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "脱离掌控，你的身躯已经衰败，你犯了太多错误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "不......这不是理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "追上去，追上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "啊，那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "在那里！我看到了喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "在兽群中前方的位置，角大了一圈、还闪着黄色光泽的那头角兽，领头兽应该就是它喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "往这边来了喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "俺可以做到的，俺可以做到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "集中精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "马上就到了，做好准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "等等......俺的鼻塞好像掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "现在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "啊？啊！不管了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "超大异臭球攻击！成功了喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "——哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "干......干掉了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "解决了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "果然没错，这些家伙都安静下来了喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "黑角，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "俺知道！俺臭死了，离你们远点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "不，你受伤了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "啊，没事，这点小伤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "幸好我这里还剩下一些应急药品，你过来，我给你处理一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "啊......哦，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "两位，你们快来看看这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "在这里，领头兽的鼻子周围有沾上灰白色的粉尘喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "欸，俺记得在哪里见过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "在我们那儿，有一种叫作烟雪鼬的生物，它释放的烟雾状的费洛蒙会让怪物兴奋起来，不顾一切地冲锋过来喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "利用这个效果来引诱怪物，我们那里“猎人”都会这么做喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "啊，记起来了，是柏生家的那些瓶瓶罐罐，难道是那位猎人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "绝对是的喵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "他知道了俺们进了林子，就用粉尘引诱了这些角兽发狂来阻挡俺们的去路吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "这么说来他确实说过：“不要让我看见你们——”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "不对，不是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "昨天中午的时候他就已经前往森林了，我们是在洞穴中遭遇意外才来到森林的，他没理由知道我们的行踪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "如果他是在森林里发现了我们，这个距离我不可能发现不了他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "这么说的话没错，而且要是他的目的也是找火龙，引发这么大的骚乱肯定会破坏火龙的踪迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "俺琢磨琢磨......或许有一种可能是，他想要拿这群角兽做些什么，但是情况脱离了他的掌控？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "......别关心这些没有意义的东西，抓紧时间找新的痕迹吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "不好了喵！小工匠又不见了喵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "刚刚在树上还在一起的喵，掉下来之后就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "啊啊啊！不会又来了......俺不要啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "text": "喵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "俺好像听到艾露猫的声音了，在那边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "text": "啊！小工匠，你怎么了喵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "text": "他好像......被臭晕了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "text": "......我希望接下来的任务里不会再有更糟糕的情况了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "今日的太阳正在衰落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看......叶隙的光线摇摇欲坠，叶底的黑暗声息渐起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "一时冲动......误入迷途的野兽们啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你们将无法从森林的黑夜归去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "text": "闭嘴......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
